OL,4,C'Elderly people are staying cold to    
OL,5,Csave cash'                             
OL,6,GToo many vulnerable elderly people are 
OL,7,Gleaving their homes cold due to fears  
OL,8,Gabout the cost of energy bills, a      
OL,9,Gheating engineer has warned.           
OL,11,FPhil Young, who is based near Evesham, 
OL,12,FWorcestershire, told the BBC he was    
OL,13,Fconcerned about elderly people         
OL,14,Fdeliberately keeping the heating off.  
OL,16,FIt comes ahead of a 26% surge in       
OL,17,Fenergy bills for millions of           
OL,18,Fhouseholds from January, due to the    
OL,19,Fprice cap rise.                        
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
