OL,4,CDowning Street's dancing TikToker      
OL,5,Cdefends visit                          
OL,6,GAn influencer has insisted his         
OL,7,Ginterview with the prime minister      
OL,8,Gfocused on serious issues, despite a   
OL,9,Gbacklash over his recreation of the    
OL,10,Gfamous dance from the film Love        
OL,11,GActually.                              
OL,13,FLuke Hamnett, who has about 1.3        
OL,14,Fmillion followers on TikTok, spoke to  
OL,15,FAndy Burnham at Number 10 for an       
OL,16,Fepisode of his Live, Laugh, Luke       
OL,17,Fpodcast.                               
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
